OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham denies he
OL,4,A'abused' position
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Sheriff of Nottingham has
OL,7,Fdenied allegations of wrongdoing after
OL,8,Fa report found he abused his position
OL,9,Fto secure a discount on car repairs,
OL,10,Fclaim gig tickets and receive free
OL,11,Fhospitality.
OL,13,FNottingham City Council Labour
OL,14,Fcouncillor Zafran Khan was found to
OL,15,Fhave breached the code of conduct by an
OL,16,Fexternal investigation, following a
OL,17,Fcomplaint in 2025.
OL,19,FKhan, who is the brother of council
OL,20,Fleader Neghat Khan, became a councillor
OL,21,Fin 2019 and held the civic role as
OL,22,Fsheriff until May.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
