OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Sheriff of Nottingham denies he
OL,4,A'abused' position
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe councillor has urged the
OL,7,Fauthority's Standards and Governance
OL,8,FCommittee to find him not guilty of
OL,9,Fbreaching the code of conduct, or to
OL,10,Fgive him "no sanction beyond a
OL,11,Frecommendation for training".
